| CREATE SQL SECURITY INVOKER VI ... ait` IS NOT NULL , `sys` . ... |
| CREATE SQL SECURITY INVOKER VI ...  , `compressed_size` ) ) DESC  |
| CREATE SQL SECURITY INVOKER VI ... LIKE ? ORDER BY `timer_start`  |
